Cell["\<\
Remember TRIG requires D6, which includes XRot[\[Pi]], even though TRIG does \
not.
Remember MONO requires XISO, which includes XRot[\[Pi]] and YRot[\[Pi]], even \
though MONO does not.\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.917748133572934*^9, 3.917748164938304*^9}, {
