Cell[TextData[{
 "Each point in the \[Theta]\[Sigma]\[Phi] coordinate block represents a \
rotation,  a \[CapitalSigma] symmetry group, and a \[CapitalSigma] subspace \
of  \[ScriptCapitalT]. Different points in the interior represent different \
orientations, but, except for the identity at the far right, all 12 points at \
the centers of the hexagonal prisms represent the same \[CapitalSigma] \
symmetry group and they represent the same \[CapitalSigma] subspace.  (Here \
\[CapitalSigma] =TRIG)  The 12 points are one left coset of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalG]", "TRIG"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"47666549-994e-48cd-b740-31a61096fe8e"],
 ". See the tex or pdf file BC_ReformulationSUPP for more explanation."
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9185164934053864`*^9, 3.9185167813613634`*^9}, {
  3.918516818560212*^9, 3.9185168268812556`*^9}, {3.9185169039178348`*^9, 
